### Retrieve Stream Platform Data

This endpoint allows users to retrieve data related to the stream platform using a HTTP GET request.

#### Request

The request does not require a request body. It should be sent to the following endpoint:

```
{{domain}}/api/chapter6_serializers_views/streamplatform-cbv-try2/

 ```

#### Response

The response will be a JSON object conforming to the following schema:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "platform_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "platform_url": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "platform_description": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```
